    "detailed_description": "Our dungeon crawler <strong>\u0394 Time</strong> (Delta Time) is a third person game which takes place in space, with atmospheric colors and glowing effects in a lit artsy pixelated style which uses interesting gameplay mechanics.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Time moves only when you move, so take your time and fight in style!</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The only way to get into the next room is by killing your enemies.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>You can charge your attack (3x) to make more damage.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Your health is not gonna regenerate! Once you die you will get back to the start of the game.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Beat the Highscore. Rooms and enemies are endless.</strong></li></ul><br>You play as a naked dude in space encircled by a bunch of evil aliens. <br>Sounds like a lot of fun, don\u2019t you think?<br><br>P.S. Beware of the moving wall \ud83d\ude1c<br>Please use a xbox controller \ud83c\udfae<br><br>\u0394 Time is the final bachelor project created by students of Salzburg University of Applied Sciences (\ud83d\udc7d\ud83d\udc7d\ud83d\udc7dMMA + \ud83d\udc7dMMT)",
    "about_the_game": "Our dungeon crawler <strong>\u0394 Time</strong> (Delta Time) is a third person game which takes place in space, with atmospheric colors and glowing effects in a lit artsy pixelated style which uses interesting gameplay mechanics.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Time moves only when you move, so take your time and fight in style!</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The only way to get into the next room is by killing your enemies.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>You can charge your attack (3x) to make more damage.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Your health is not gonna regenerate! Once you die you will get back to the start of the game.</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Beat the Highscore. Rooms and enemies are endless.</strong></li></ul><br>You play as a naked dude in space encircled by a bunch of evil aliens. <br>Sounds like a lot of fun, don\u2019t you think?<br><br>P.S. Beware of the moving wall \ud83d\ude1c<br>Please use a xbox controller \ud83c\udfae<br><br>\u0394 Time is the final bachelor project created by students of Salzburg University of Applied Sciences (\ud83d\udc7d\ud83d\udc7d\ud83d\udc7dMMA + \ud83d\udc7dMMT)",
